<title>USA: Smart Modular names Mullin CFO.</title>
<headline>Smart Modular names Mullin CFO.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smart Modular Technologies Inc said Monday it has appointed David Mullin as chief financial officer and vice president of finance, effective today, replacing  Lata Krishnan, who will become vice president of business development.</p>
<p>Mullin was most recently chief financial officer at Borland International Inc and also served as CFO at a subsidary of Conner Peripherals Inc, the company said.</p>
<p>SMART makes specialty memory modules for the computer, networking and telecommunications industries.</p>
